                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_1684883797">40 times clamp Cl.15_1 change</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_1962379005">This DTC indicates that the System Basis Chip has not been successfully configured. As a consequence the SBC triggers a reset after a timeout of 256ms and the MCU repeats the configuration of the SBC.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Possible_Impact" TI="TI_102334147">No INV_BUS communication, no HV activation, No Park Lock avaliabe until ignition cycle or automated
cold-restart. If ignition cycle change is not performed in 10 minutes VCU will shutdown itself. Vehicle is only able to roll out. Re-activation of HV is first possible after standstill is reached and ignition cycle change.</SD>
                                        </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                </DTC>
