                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_1684883797">40 times clamp Cl.15_1 change</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_1058281436">This DTC indicates a under voltage condition of the internal voltage regulator which is intended to deliver the main power supply to the Microcontroller Unit (VEXT). Since the voltage is below the operating conditions of the Microcontroller, the safety related function enters the safe state and performs a reset.</SD>
