                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_1684883797">40 times clamp Cl.15_1 change</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_43675318">This DTC indicates a under voltage condition of the internal voltage (VPRE) which is acts as a pre regulator for the voltage regulators for Core supply . Since the voltage is below the operating conditions of the System Basis Chip itself, the cascaded voltage regulator VCORE will result in a undervoltage condition.</SD>
