                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_1936688873">an uncorrectable and critical failure detected in the SRAM</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_1929527869">no uncorrectable and critical failure detected in the SRAM</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_752461108">Record DTC, perform safe-self reset, remain in a Safe state until ignition cycle change</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_1684883797">40 times clamp Cl.15_1 change</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_885160689">This DTC indicates a uncorrectable and critical failure in the SRAM. This single points failures are detected by the HW safety mechanism (eg. ECC) when an access is done to the defect RAM area. The safety mechanisms reports the failure to the SMUCore which triggers a fails safe reset by the System Basis Chip.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Possible_Impact" TI="TI_102334147">No INV_BUS communication, no HV activation, No Park Lock avaliabe until ignition cycle or automated
cold-restart. If ignition cycle change is not performed in 10 minutes VCU will shutdown itself. Vehicle is only able to roll out. Re-activation of HV is first possible after standstill is reached and ignition cycle change.</SD>
                                        </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                </DTC>
