                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_1683649268">This DTC indicates a uncorrectable and critical failure in the FLASH (NVRAM). This single points failures are detected by HW safety mechanisms (eg. ECC / EDC...) when an access is done to the defect FLASH (NVRAM) area. The safety mechanism reports the failure to the SMUCore which triggers a fails safe reset by the System Basis Chip.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Possible_Impact" TI="TI_102334147">No INV_BUS communication, no HV activation, No Park Lock avaliabe until ignition cycle or automated
cold-restart. If ignition cycle change is not performed in 10 minutes VCU will shutdown itself. Vehicle is only able to roll out. Re-activation of HV is first possible after standstill is reached and ignition cycle change.</SD>
