                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_1684883797">40 times clamp Cl.15_1 change</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_55080091">This DTC indicates a unintended access to a RAM area from one of the Microcontroller cores. In order to support the execution of SW components with different ASIL level, the access to RAM ares is restricted by the Memory Protection Unit. (freedom of interference). The safety mechanism reports the failure to the SMUCore which triggers a fails safe reset by the System Basis Chip.</SD>
